====Usage notes====
* This word is sometimes cited as the Finnish word that contains the largest number (7) of consecutive vocals, but there's little evidence of it ever being actually used as other than curiosity. Another artificial construction, {{m|fi|riiuuyöaie}} contains as many as nine consecutive vowels.

